; Regression: after K0100 at a token that cannot follow `.` or `else`, the parser also
; reported K0102 ("expected a line break before this") at the same token, with a
; machine-applicable fix that inserted a line break which fixes nothing (`x.` then continues on
; the next line and still lacks a member name). K0102 is not reported at a token that already
; has a parser diagnostic.
(SourceFile
  (FuncDecl func f (ParamList)
    (Block
      (MemberExpr (NameExpr x))
      (MemberExpr (Literal 5) y)
      (IfExpr if (NameExpr a) (Block) else)
      (NameExpr b))))
